#. Tag: title
#: getkde.docbook:8
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting &kde;"
msgstr "ការយក KDE"

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where do I get &kde;?"
msgstr "តើ​ខ្ញុំ​យក KDE ពី​កន្លែង​ណា ?"

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The main distribution site for &kde; is <ulink url=\"ftp://ftp.kde.org/"
"\">ftp.kde.org</ulink>. However, this site is often under heavy load, so you "
"might prefer to use <ulink url=\"http://download.kde.org/\">download.kde."
"org</ulink> which automatically redirects you to the mirror nearest to you. "
"You can also have a look at the list of <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/"
"ftpmirrors.html\"> &kde; mirror sites</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"តំបន់​ចែកចាយ​សំខាន់​របស់ KDE គឺ <ulink url=\"ftp://ftp.kde.org/\">ftp.kde.org</ulink> "
"។ ប៉ុន្តែ តំបន់​នេះ​មាន​បន្ទុក​យ៉ាង​ធ្ងន់ធ្ង​ ដូច្នេះ​អ្នក​អាចប្រើ <ulink url=\"http://download.kde."
"org/\">download.kde.org</ulink> ដែល​នាំ​អ្នក​ទៅ​កាន់​តំបន់​កញ្ចក់​ដែល​នៅ​ជិត​អ្នក​បំផុត ។ អ្នក​ថែមទាំង​"
"អាច​មើល​​នូវ​បញ្ជី​​<ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/ftpmirrors.html\">តំបន់​កញ្ចក់​របស់ KDE</"
"ulink> បានទៀត​ផង ។"

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Are there &Linux; distributions that include &kde;?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes, major &Linux; distributions already ship &kde;. As building a "
"distribution takes some time, they might not always contain the latest "
"version, but for a start or to avoid downloading from the Internet, they do "
"provide a good starting point."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can find an up-to-date list of distributions that ship with &kde; <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.kde.org/download/distributions.php\">here</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is the current version?"
msgstr "តើ​បច្ចុប្បន្ន​ដល់​កំណែ​ប៉ុន្មាន ?"

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Currently, the latest stable version is 3.5.5"
msgstr "បច្ចុប្បន្ន កំណែ​ចុងក្រោយ​បំផុត​គឺ ៣.៥.៥"

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/info/3.5.5.php\">&kde; 3.5.5 Info Page</"
"ulink> contains a lot of information specific to this release."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"http://www.kde.org/info/3.5.5.php\">ទំព័រ​ព័ត៌មាន​របស់ KDE ៣.៥.៥</"
"ulink> មាន​ព័ត៌មាន​​ជា​ច្រើន​ដែល​បញ្ជាក់​អំពី​ការ​ចេញផ្សាយ​នេះ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where do I find &kde; snapshots?"
msgstr "តើ​ខ្ញុំ​អាច​រក​រូបថត KDE បាននៅ​កន្លែង​ណា ?"

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can get the latest snapshots from <ulink url=\"ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/"
"unstable/snapshots\">ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/unstable/snapshots</ulink>. "
"You might also want to consider setting up your own <acronym>SVN</acronym> "
"client in order to maintain the latest snapshot at all times. Please refer "
"to <ulink url=\"http://developer.kde.org/source/anonsvn.html\">Anonymous "
"<acronym>SVN</acronym> and &kde;</ulink> for further information."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​យក​រូបថត​ចុងក្រោយ​បំផុត​ពី <ulink url=\"ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/unstable/"
"snapshots\">ftp://ftp.kde.org/pub/kde/unstable/snapshots</ulink> ។ អ្នក​ប្រហែល​ជា​"
"ត្រូវ​រៀបចំ​ម៉ាស៊ីន​ភ្ញៀវ <acronym>SVN</acronym> ផ្ទាល់ខ្លួន​របស់​អ្នក​ដើម្បី​ថែទាំ​រូបថត​ចុងក្រោយ​គ្រប់ពេល​"
"ទាំងអស់ ។ ចំពោះ​ព័ត៌មាន​បន្ថែម សូម​យោង​លើ <ulink url=\"http://developer.kde.org/source/"
"anonsvn.html\"> <acronym>SVN</acronym> និង KDE អនាមិក</ulink> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where do I get &Qt;?"
msgstr "តើ​ខ្ញុំ​​អាច​យក Qt™ នៅ​កន្លែង​ណា ?"

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&Qt; is a product of the Norwegian company Trolltech. You can always get the "
"latest &Qt; version from their <ulink url=\"ftp://ftp.trolltech.com\">&FTP; "
"server</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Qt™ គឺ​ជា​ផលិត​ផល​របស់ Norwegian company Trolltech ។ អ្នក​អាច​យក​កំណែ​ចុងក្រោយ​បំផុត​របស់ Qt™ ពី "
"<ulink url=\"ftp://ftp.trolltech.com\">ម៉ាស៊ីន​បម្រើ FTP</ulink> របស់​ពួកគេ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: getkde.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"And with most up-to-date &Linux; distributions, &Qt; is already included. "
"Please see <xref linkend=\"prerequisites\"/> for the version of &Qt; you "
"need."
msgstr ""
"ហើយ​ Qt™ ក៏​បាន​ដាក់​បញ្ចូល​ជា​មួយ​នឹង​ការ​ចែកចាយ​ លីនុច ដែល​ទាន់​សម័យ​បំផុត​ផងដែរ ។ សូម​មើល <xref "
"linkend=\"prerequisites\"/> ចំពោះ​កំណែ​របស់ Qt™ ដែល​អ្នក​ត្រូវការ ។"

